  "description": "The image depicts a formal bilateral meeting between U.S. and Mexican officials, which is a standard diplomatic format. The meme's sarcasm relies on the understanding that such meetings are typically serious and substantive, but the text overlays imply that Mexico is only engaging in immigration talks under duress or when it suits U.S. interests. This requires knowledge of how diplomatic negotiations work and how they are often portrayed in media and political discourse.",
